Native engine app (experiments/native-engine/frontend): melee-unlocked's phillip_ai.cpp ("Fight a pro") built into the
app with MU_PROAI_FRONTEND: the policies run on the app's own engine (src/proai/onnx_lite.cpp, behind the
onnxruntime-shaped calls of src/proai/include/onnxruntime_c_api.h) instead of a loaded onnxruntime; the ProAI folder is
the app's (sdmc:/switch/melee-nx-netplay/ProAI/); every policy is timed on the console before it plays (upstream's
check for a processor without AVX); nothing downloads unless the player chose it (the base policies through
download_base, the matchup policies through "Stronger Pro AI", which here covers every matchup policy); the policy
workers get the console's core and priority. Applied to a build-time copy only (build/native-engine-gfx/gen/proai).
